Z||000000||86seyellow||05-02-2001||05:25 PM||||ok cat is changed, totally clogged, new wires, plugs, dist cap, rotor, fuel pump, it sounds cooler and meaner and more power but still from 30 40 in 4th gear she shudders shakes and lacks power. What else could be going on||||reg||1
Z||000001||88formula||05-02-2001||09:47 PM||||Does it buck and shake the car under a load? Does it sound like a misfiring/leaking ignition system? The coil may have a crack or carbon tracking that is causing the ignition to seek an alternative path other than the spark plug under a load. Use soapy water from a spray bottle and spray the coil. Put the engine under a load and if its gets worse you have a leaking ignition coil.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||84Bill||05-02-2001||11:20 PM||||Jeaz man your stumpin me. I agree with 88 sounds like could be a coil problem. I was thinking MAP but that usually effects low rpm power but you got a load on there (no pun) usually spark associated. Does it carry on like that through other gears as well?<p>[This message has been edited by 84Bill (edited 05-02-2001).]||||reg||9
